#~ msgid "How much memory to use for ready-scaled book covers. A bigger cache keeps more covers warm -- smoother paging and preloading -- at the cost of RAM. Default 24 MB. Lower it if memory is tight; raise it on a device with plenty of RAM. (How many covers that holds depends on their size: roughly 200-400 small grayscale covers, fewer large or color ones.)"
